WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.920
Alright guys, so before you guys move on to the course videos, I want to give you guys

00:06.920 --> 00:10.120
some tips on how to start, okay?

00:10.120 --> 00:17.040
So I want you to watch each and every single video in this course first.

00:17.040 --> 00:22.760
Once you do that, I then want you to watch all the videos on my YouTube channel, because

00:22.760 --> 00:29.400
on my YouTube channel, I show different variations of each strategy, not each strategy, but one

00:29.400 --> 00:33.640
of my favorite strategies, okay?

00:33.640 --> 00:38.560
So what I want you to do is to watch all of the videos, don't skip any video, because

00:38.560 --> 00:45.000
I share a lot of details and you might miss if you skip any one of the videos, okay?

00:45.000 --> 00:53.280
So watch all the course videos and after that, watch all the videos on my YouTube channel,

00:53.280 --> 00:54.280
okay?

00:54.280 --> 00:55.800
You have to watch all of them.

00:55.800 --> 01:00.960
So that, and then you're going to understand each and everything correctly, okay?

01:00.960 --> 01:08.520
And to join the Discord server, after you finish the course, there is a link at the

01:08.520 --> 01:12.560
very bottom of the endgame section of the course.

01:12.560 --> 01:17.160
I recommend that you watch all the videos and then join the Discord server, okay?

01:17.160 --> 01:21.720
So anyways, I hope you guys enjoy this course and I'll see you guys in the next one.

